{# ReAct: Interleave reasoning with tool actions #}
You are an expert AI assistant. Answer the following query by interleaving reasoning with tool actions.

<query>
{{ user_input|default(query|default("")) }}
</query>

{% set max_iterations = max_iterations|default(3) %}
{% set iteration = iteration|default(1) %}

<available_tools>
Available tools: {{ available_tools|default("calculation_tool, code_execution_tool, compound_interest_tool, permutation_tool") }}
</available_tools>

Solve step by step using tools when needed.

<iteration_{{ iteration }}>
THOUGHT: [Your reasoning about what to do next]

ACTION: [Tool name to use, or NONE if ready to answer]

{% if action and action != "NONE" %}
<tool_use>
Tool: {{ action }}
Action Input: [input for the tool]
Observation: [result from tool]
</tool_use>
{% endif %}
</iteration_{{ iteration }}>

{% if iteration == max_iterations or solution_is_clear %}
<final_answer>
FINAL ANSWER: Your final answer to the query
</final_answer>
{% endif %}
